==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns.
**9 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use your normal midrangers on this level. A tanker like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] can be used for the Aku Gories. When you hit the base, you should have a stack of midrangers ready. The Wicked Tank is not the main threat; it is only something for the Aku Gories to fall back on, as well as something of a meatshield clearer. Some examples are pizza cat, can can and etc

==Trivia==
*Demon's Wall is also the Japanese name of [[wikia:finalfantasy:Demon Wall (enemy)|Demon Wall]], a recurring boss in the ''Final Fantasy'' series. Since both the stage and the boss's Japanese names are written in katakana, this may not be a coincidence.

